      contains exactly one max solid rectangle with h>=2 and w>=2 (area 4-8);
      may have 1-2 tied max rects (1 comp in 1 example had 2 ties, rest had 1);
      remaining cells form thin arms/branches around the rectangle
    non_qualifying: 28-43 per grid; size 1-16 cells;
